text: >-
  INTERNAL MEMO

  FROM: Charlie Kirk, Founder & CEO

  TO: Turning Point USA Employees

  DATE: September 2, 2025

  RE: Chief Operating Officer

  Dear Team America.

  Effective immodiately, Justin Streiff is taking on a now, clevatod role with
  Turning Point USA as its

  Chief Operating Officer (COO)

  Since joining Turning Point USA in 2020, Justin has led Turning Point's
  Fundraising division and in more

  recent years has been involved in some organizational operations, filling this
  COO role in many

  ways but now officially taking on the title and expanded ro ponsibilitics.

  In this COO role, Justin will directly oversce: Development, Events, Finance,
  TPUSA Faith.

  Modia/Marketing Productions, Asset Management, Distribution, Turning Point
  Education, BLEXIT. HR.

  and Legal. Justin will also closely coordinate with Andrew Sypher on the
  National Field Program

  In this role, I have empowered Justin, among other priorities, to engage in an
  organizational-wide

  "DOGE" effort. Justin will be assembling a small Icam to assist in this
  effort, which is focused on

  Turing Point USA I) becoming more efficient, 2) becoming more cost-effective,
  3) unifying

  organizational success around compuny-aside metrics and goals, and 4)
  reshaping company culture I

  expect many positive changes to come from this forthcoming initiative and
  Justin'S expanded role.

  Please join me in congratulating Justin on this new role with the
  organization.

  As always, thank you for everything cach of you do for Turning Point USA. Now,
  let's got back to work

  and save Amenica!

  Thank You,

  Charlie Kirk

  FOUNDER & CEO
